OL,3,GNEWSARapist who attacked sleeping woman
OL,4,Ajailed                                 
OL,6,FA man who raped a woman and took       
OL,7,Fphotographs of her while she was asleep
OL,8,Fhas been jailed.                       
OL,10,FRosen Vasilev, 27, attacked the woman  
OL,11,Fwhile she was intoxicated and "in a    
OL,12,Fvulnerable state" and then took        
OL,13,Fphotographs of her engaged in sexual   
OL,14,Factivity in November 2023, Cumbria     
OL,15,FPolice said.                           
OL,17,FThe force said his trial was then      
OL,18,Fdelayed and adjourned several times,   
OL,19,F"extending what was already a difficult
OL,20,Fand distressing process for the        
OL,21,Fvictim", before he admitted the        
OL,22,Foffences on 6 August.                  
